Getting Started
Launching the Module
The transformation module opens automatically when you: - Select “Transform Network” from the main menu of the main application
Note: For best results, your network should include geographic coordinate data (latitude and longitude for all nodes). If you import a network without spatial coordinates, you can easily geo-reference it within AquaStream360.
