Advanced Features
Keyboard Navigation
•	Arrow Keys: Translate network (when no input field focused)
•	Up/Down in spin boxes: Increment/decrement values
•	Tab: Navigate between controls
Drag and Drop Translation
1.	Check “Enable Drag (double-click to grab)”
2.	Double-click on plot or map
3.	Drag to move entire network
4.	Release mouse to stop
5.	Works in both plot and map views
Marker Size Adjustment
•	Slider: Changes display size of nodes (visual only)
•	Does not affect actual coordinates or network data
•	Useful for presentations or dense networks
Grid Display
•	Toggle on/off with checkbox
•	When off: Clean view, no axes
•	When on: Engineering grid with coordinates
•	Recommended: On for precision work, Off for map alignment
